NOTE ON BUNDLED DATA (NOT covered by the MIT licence above)

The MIT licence covers only the original source code of this project
(index.html, eibi_sync.py, sw.js, manifest.webmanifest, icons and documentation).

The broadcast-schedule data files (eibi.json, eibi.meta.json, sked_eibi.csv and
any schedule data downloaded at runtime) are NOT original to this project. They
are compiled from third-party sources, each under its own terms:

  - HFCC/IBD public data   — http://www.hfcc.org/  (publicly published
                             coordination data, "free access")
  - Bi Newsletter for DXers (commonly known as the AOKI list)
                             — http://www1.s2.starcat.ne.jp/ndxc/
                             No licence is stated by the compiler. Redistributed
                             here in good faith for non-commercial use, with
                             attribution. (A non-commercial, attribution norm is
                             common practice in the DX community; it is not a
                             licence stated by the compiler.)
  - EiBi Shortwave Schedules by Eike Bierwirth
                             — http://eibispace.de/  (free to download, use,
                             copy, distribute and use within third-party software)

See legal.html for the full attribution, usage terms and privacy information.
These data files are redistributed in good faith for non-commercial use; they
remain the property of their respective compilers.
